{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49527","headline":"谒金门 二 · 魏承班","name":"谒金门 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春欲半，堆砌落花千片。\n早是潘郎长不见，忍听双语燕。\n飞絮晴空扬远，风送谁家弦管。\n愁倚画屏凡事嬾，泪沾金缕线。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏承班","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}